{"title":"1992 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Five test scores have a mean (average score) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, a median (middle score) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and a mode (most frequent score) of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698a90ad1ee1841d9c2a4a80e0a32cbd6b252181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />.  The sum of the two lowest test scores is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/b/9db923f373252a61e57a661ec6850544b8a1055b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 170 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 171 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 176 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 177 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{not determined by the information given}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"690\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because there was an odd number of scores, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> must be the middle score. Since there are two scores above <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698a90ad1ee1841d9c2a4a80e0a32cbd6b252181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> appears the most frequent (so at least twice) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/e/a0eb8aa840d2b4b161abff523523bcc32d528224.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94&gt;91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/698a90ad1ee1841d9c2a4a80e0a32cbd6b252181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$94$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" /> appears twice. Also, the sum of the five numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf33b29605287dfde90a3c8a22240746b931583a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90 \\times 5 =450$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, the sum of the lowest two scores is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/c/cfc87dfeac313d1dbcf071ca80c5d5910d331fb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450-91-94-94= \\boxed{\\text{(B)}\\ 171}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"242\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align: